		(at 161.435 110.12 90)
		(descr "TSSOP-16 0.65 mm with hand-solder toes (to +-3.9 mm) and one 0.7 mm round test pad per pin: two staggered columns per side (x +-4.45 / +-5.1 mm), each pad straight out from its pin (odd pins inner column, even pins outer), numbered like the pin (same net); the board joins each pin to its pad with a straight 0.2 mm F.Cu track. PicoGUS THT v1.3.2.")
